"o-color-2\">✦ </span>Track record of organizational leadership at &gt;€5B "
"enterprise scale<br><br><span class=\"text-o-color-2\">✦ </span>Deep "
"knowledge of European infrastructure regulatory environments<br><br><span "
"class=\"text-o-color-2\">✦ </span>Fluent English; additional European "
