#. module: headhunter
#: model_terms:hr.job,website_description:headhunter.hr_job_4
msgid ""
"The current CEO is stepping down after eight years having successfully taken "
"the group from €3.1B to €9.2B AuM and completed the group's recent "
"<strong>€1.4B capital raise</strong>. The board is seeking a successor who "
"can extend the group's ambition into new geographies and asset classes while "
"maintaining its reputation for governance excellence."
msgstr ""
"CEO ຄົນປັດຈຸບັນກຳລັງຈະກ້າວລົງຈາກຕຳແໜ່ງຫຼັງຈາກດຳລົງຕຳແໜ່ງມາເປັນເວລາ 8 ປີ "
"ໂດຍປະສົບຜົນສຳເລັດໃນການນຳພາກຸ່ມບໍລິສັດເຕີບໂຕຈາກ AuM €3.1B ຂຶ້ນເປັນ €9.2B ແລະ ສຳເລັດ "
"<strong>ການລະດົມທຶນ €1.4B</strong> ເມື່ອບໍ່ດົນມານີ້. "
"ສະພາບໍລິຫານກຳລັງຊອກຫາຜູ້ສືບທອດຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ສາມາດສານຕໍ່ຄວາມມຸ່ງຫວັງຂອງກຸ່ມບໍລິສັດໄປສູ່ເຂດພື້ນທີ່ ແລະ "
"ປະເພດຊັບສິນໃໝ່ໆ ພ້ອມທັງຮັກສາຊື່ສຽງດ້ານທຳມາພິບານທີ່ດີເລີດໄວ້."

#. module: headhunter
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:headhunter.welcome_article_body
msgid "The customer reminders."
msgstr "ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນລູກຄ້າ."

#. module: headhunter
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:headhunter.welcome_article_body
msgid "The financial reporting."
msgstr "ການລາຍງານທາງການເງິນ."

#. module: headhunter
#: model_terms:hr.job,website_description:headhunter.hr_job_6
msgid ""
"The founding CTO is transitioning to a Chief Architect role to focus on deep "
"research. The incoming CTO will take full engineering and platform "
"ownership, manage a 90-person engineering organization, and lead Lumix "
"through its IPO preparation in the 2027–2028 window."
msgstr ""
"CTO ຜູ້ຮ່ວມກໍ່ຕັ້ງກຳລັງປ່ຽນຜ່ານໄປຮັບບົດບາດ Chief Architect ເພື່ອສຸມໃສ່ການຄົ້ນຄວ້າຢ່າງເລິກເຊິ່ງ. CTO "
"ຄົນໃໝ່ຈະເຂົ້າມາເບິ່ງແຍງງານວິສະວະກຳ ແລະ ແພລັດຟອມທັງໝົດ, ຄຸ້ມຄອງທີມວິສະວະກຳ 90 ຄົນ ແລະ ນຳພາ "
"Lumix ກຽມພ້ອມເຂົ້າສູ່ຕະຫຼາດຫຼັກຊັບ (IPO) ໃນຊ່ວງປີ 2027–2028."

#. module: headhunter
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:headhunter.welcome_article_body
